&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;National Account Executive - Retail&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as a key operational and commercial partner to our National Account Managers across our key retail channels (Majors, Independents, and Petrol &amp;amp; Convenience). You will act as a primary liaison with retail buying teams to coordinate promotional execution, evaluate campaign performance, and partner cross-functionally across Marketing, Finance, and Supply Chain to drive the growth of our Youfoodz retail business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Chippendale, Sydney&lt;/strong&gt; and reports to the &lt;strong&gt;Senior National Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately track and manage customer promotional mechanics, trade spend investment, and records of promotional activity and pricing changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Commercial Finance to proactively investigate, track, and resolve customer claims, deductions, and discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate weekly, monthly, and quarterly sales and commercial performance reports, highlighting key trends and variances for the NAM team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize retail market and competitor insights across in-store, digital, and e-commerce channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support demand planning and supply chain teams by providing volume forecasts based on confirmed promotional plans, monitoring stock-on-hand status, and mitigating out-of-stock risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare impactful presentation materials for annual range reviews, category reviews, and new product development (NPD) sell-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the timely delivery of product samples, marketing assets, and retailer compliance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the operational bridge between the sales team and internal departments to troubleshoot day-to-day retailer queries regarding logistics, invoicing, and POS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of experience in an analytical, administrative, field sales, or commercial support role within the FMCG or retail sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field (or equivalent professional experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel (pivot tables, VLOOKUPs, data visualization) and experience managing complex commercial datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP or Trade Promotion Management (TPM) systems, retailer portals, or syndicated market data (e.g., Nielsen, IRI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the Australian retail landscape, commercial mechanics, and industry terminology (e.g., JBPs, trade spend, range reviews).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail-oriented with a strong focus on data accuracy and financial integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional organizer capable of balancing multiple cross-functional processes and retailer deadlines simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive problem-solver driven to investigate root causes and optimize operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, collaborative communicator confident in managing both internal cross-functional stakeholders and external retail buyer contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
