&lt;li&gt;Proven experience at Activation Director level in a Digital Media or Advertising role (including some aspects of managing P&amp;amp;L)​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Project Management, Leadership and People Management Experience​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with planning and running large-scale paid social activity on Facebook, Twitter, and LinkedIn, either directly or via third party platforms​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of media planning fundamentals e.g. reach, frequency, channels, formats, etc.​&lt;/li&gt;
