&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is seeking a Head of Strategy &amp;amp; Insights to lead the global media strategies for one of the most prestigious global luxury groups in the world. Sitting at the intersection of culture, audience, planning, and insights, you will oversee a talented team to deliver transformative media strategies across a prestigious portfolio of Maisons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this critical leadership role, we are seeking an &quot;M-shaped&quot; talent. You bring a broad knowledge of communications, media, and luxury, combining big-picture strategic thinking with the technical fluency to dive into expert topics. You are equally comfortable advising on high-level strategy as you are coordinating specialized teams to turn macro-visions into high-quality execution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a trusted advisor to Maisons C-suite stakeholders, you will go beyond traditional media planning to shape long-term brand equity, champion luxury intelligence, and elevate planning excellence across our global network of over 40 markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* Location: Paris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* Team management: 5-6 people (Senior to Manager Media Planning &amp;amp; Insights Talents)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* Client: Global Luxury group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* Language: French &amp;amp; English&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning Excellence&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership: Direct and inspire a global team of five strategic planners (ranging from Manager to Senior profiles), ensuring the high-quality delivery of strategic media recommendations across diverse briefs and a varied Maisons portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Media Strategy: Define the overarching annual media strategy for the group leading Maisons, across various luxury categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media Guidelines: Define and oversee the creation of media planning guidelines (annual or high-stakes campaigns). Establish their structure and coordinate relevant internal teams (e.g., Social and Search experts) to ensure their successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning Framework: Elevate local market planning quality by refining existing planning frameworks and enforcing their adoption, supported directly by the Planning &amp;amp; Insights Capabilities Associate Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Luxury Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Intelligence&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Agenda: Define the annual Luxury Thought Leadership calendar; oversee the creation and presentation of high-impact intelligence reports and global webinars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Macro-Consultancy: Partner with Maisons and relevant WPP agencies on forward-looking, long-term prospective topics that extend well beyond pure paid media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge Ecosystem: Foster a culture of luxury intelligence-sharing, ensuring a seamless flow of insights between central and local market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Insights Capability: Manage and mentor the Insights &amp;amp; Planning Capabilities Associate Director to enforce the consistent application of WPP Media &quot;hero&quot; planning and insight tools across the entire account network, ensuring data-driven strategic foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Research Agenda: In collaboration with the Insights &amp;amp; Planning Capabilities Associate Director, define the global studies agenda, overseeing research execution and the delivery of actionable insights to the client.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Local Market Support &amp;amp; Connectivity&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Upskilling: Refine and deploy planning and insights training programs tailored for local market teams and planning resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Synergy: Build influential relationships with top-tier global markets to capture local best practices, maximize global strategy adoption, and elevate localized execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Strategic Planning Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 10–15+ years of experience within integrated communications and media planning, with a heavy emphasis on global or multi-market accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Luxury Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, demonstrable expertise within the luxury sector (Fashion, Jewelry, and Watches preferred), with a thorough understanding of the luxury consumer mindset and differences across Maisons and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Comms Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to think beyond traditional paid media, demonstrating an integrated communications planning mindset that connects media strategy with broader cultural and brand ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Gravitas:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional presentation and communication skills, with a proven ability to engage, persuade, and challenge C-suite executives through strong, well-reasoned convictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Management:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of managing, mentoring, and inspiring diverse strategic teams; a natural collaborator and team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly flexible thinker capable of adapting strategic frameworks across a wide variety of brands with vastly different budgets, target audiences, and ambitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Department Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to collaborate with and coordinate across diverse, specialized expert teams (e.g., Social, Search, and Centralized Buying) to align channel tactics with overarching macro-strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;/strong&gt;: Full professional fluency in both English and French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;: A genuine appetite for working in a highly international, multicultural environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to &lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also &lt;strong&gt;Lead Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;, firmly believing in and &lt;strong&gt;Championing Growth &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Development &lt;/strong&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;The role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the day-to-day operation of an AI Reliability Engineering team of eight to ten engineers across EMEA. You own the people, the queue, the rota, and the escalations. You report to the AIR Senior Manager for EMEA, who holds strategy, budget, and the senior customer relationships, so your time goes on running a world-class operation and growing the engineers in it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estate is about 29,000 GPUs today, with a planning target of one million by the end of 2027. You are the first manager hired under the Senior Manager, and as the region grows you take ownership of a full pillar with its own queue and SOPs. It is a hands-on role: close enough to GPUs, Linux, and high-performance fabrics to lead an incident and challenge a diagnosis, while leading the team most of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of eight to ten AI Reliability Engineers: 1:1s, objectives, reviews, probation, development, and hiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the queue: prioritization, SLA adherence, MTTR, and backlog, with a named owner on every near-breach ticket and clean handoffs to Engineering and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the rota and on-call for the team within the EMEA coverage model and the global follow-the-sun handover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first management escalation point on P1s and customer escalations, lead post-incident reviews, and turn repeat incidents into problem records and durable fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the SOPs for your pillar and drive them into Nscale&#39;s automation so that repeatable remediation needs less human time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the day-to-day relationships with DC Operations, Network Operations, Engineering, and the fleet tooling and automation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report your team&#39;s numbers weekly and accurately, and explain what moved and why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About you&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 6+ years in infrastructure, operations, or support engineering in production environments, including 2+ years around GPU, HPC, or large data center estates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: 3+ years managing engineers in an operational support function, owning reviews, development plans, and performance management through to outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: you have run a queue against SLAs and are comfortable being accountable for the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: clear, specific, and concise, in writing and in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decisiveness and pragmatism&lt;/strong&gt;: you make calls with incomplete information, improve process without slowing delivery, and commit once the decision is made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical foundation&lt;/strong&gt;: solid production Linux and networking, working knowledge of how GPU fleets fail and get repaired, ITIL and SRE habits, and enough scripting to review an engineer&#39;s work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable with out-of-hours escalations, on-call, and travel to data centers and customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NVIDIA GPU platform depth: nvidia-smi, DCGM, and XID interpretation through to RMA (AMD Instinct beneficial)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;InfiniBand or RoCE diagnostics, NCCL, NVLink and NVSwitch, and Slurm with Pyxis and Enroot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rack-scale systems such as GB200 and GB300 NVL72&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BMC and Redfish, MAAS, NetBox, OpenStack, Kubernetes, and Ansible or Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-performance storage such as VAST, Ceph, or NFS at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow-the-sun operations, and ITIL, Linux, networking, Kubernetes, or NVIDIA certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As Reddit continues to scale its advertising business, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Solutions Manager&lt;/strong&gt; based in London to help drive the success of Reddit Ads across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role that works across the Reddit Ads product portfolio, with particular expertise in app advertising technologies. You’ll act as a trusted technical advisor to advertisers, agencies, partners, Sales, Product, Engineering, and regional go-to-market teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll lead complex investigations across campaign creation, delivery, measurement, reporting, APIs, integrations, funding, account access, and third-party reporting. You’ll also translate recurring technical issues and customer feedback into product improvements, scalable guidance, and more effective operating processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is expected to work from the London office 1–2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex technical investigations:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose and resolve ambiguous advertiser and partner issues across Ads Manager, campaign creation, targeting, ad experiences, delivery, pacing, auctions, reporting, measurement, Business Manager, asset sharing, funding instruments, credit lines, account access, APIs, integrations, MMP and SKAN workflows, validation requests, and third-party reporting discrepancies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise customers and partners:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted technical advisor, translating business objectives into practical recommendations across implementation, measurement, troubleshooting, and platform usage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage escalations end to end:&lt;/strong&gt; Triage urgent and revenue-impacting issues, coordinate the appropriate Product and Engineering stakeholders, maintain clear communication, and drive resolution against agreed service expectations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply structured technical analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Use logs, data, APIs, event payloads, developer tools, documentation, and reproducible test cases to isolate root causes and distinguish between configuration issues, integration failures, measurement discrepancies, and product defects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence product and engineering priorities:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify recurring technical issues, regional friction points, and operational gaps. Turn findings into clear business narratives, evidence-based recommendations, and actionable roadmap feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support product quality and launches:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Engineering to test new features, validate advertiser workflows, identify risks before launch, and improve technical readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create scalable solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Convert recurring issues into runbooks, documentation, enablement, tooling, and automation that reduce repeat investigations and improve the customer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve AI-assisted support workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage and refine AI-enabled support flows, ensuring that outputs are accurate, well governed, and aligned with Reddit Ads processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build structure in a growing function:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify support gaps, establish repeatable processes, strengthen relationships across teams, and help shape how EMEA Technical Solutions operates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent EMEA Technical Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Share regional customer impact and technical insights with global Technical Solutions, Sales, Product, Engineering, and go-to-market leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in on-call support:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a senior rotation supporting critical, revenue-blocking platform issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in technical solutions, solutions engineering, ad technology, digital advertising, measurement, integrations, or a related customer-facing technical role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of digital advertising ecosystems, including campaign setup, targeting, delivery, pacing, bidding or auction dynamics, reporting, attribution, measurement, and advertiser troubleshooting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in mobile app advertising, including app event instrumentation, SDK and MMP configuration, attribution flows, SKAN, and app campaign diagnostics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with REST APIs and technical integrations, including reading API documentation, testing endpoints, analysing request and response payloads, and troubleshooting authentication and permission issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using logs, data analysis, developer tools, and reproducible test cases to investigate technical issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of web technologies and digital protocols, including JavaScript, HTML, CSS, APIs, feeds, and XML.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to prioritise customer impact, revenue risk, urgency, and scalable solutions in ambiguous situations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex technical issues to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering effectively with Sales, Product, Engineering, Support, and external technology providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate independently, lead through influence, and create structure in a developing function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;BA/BS Degree&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
