&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Robotics &amp;amp; Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;C++ Software Engineer (m/f/d) Platform Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, who will help build and maintain the C++ platform infrastructure our robot runs on. You will help us ensure it runs reliably and safely once it is out of the lab and in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain modern C++ software components for the robot&#39;s Linux-based platform infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; IPC:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain the IPC and communication interfaces that connect robot applications, backend services, and hardware-facing components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging &amp;amp; Diagnostics:&lt;/strong&gt; Debug concurrency, timing, memory, performance, and system-integration issues across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Build unit, integration, and hardware-oriented test infrastructure for platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve system reliability through better diagnostics, logging, fault handling, and recovery mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and integrate software on real robotic hardware, working with firmware, control, backend, QA, and DevOps engineers when problems cross those boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field, or an equivalent combination of training and experience, with initial professional experience building production C++ software, typically up to about three years and excluding internships or working-student positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern C++:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience writing C++ using modern practices (C++17/C++20), gained through professional work, internships, or substantial project experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Working understanding of Linux system programming — processes, threads, synchronization, IPC, and sockets — along with asynchronous programming concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical debugging experience using tools such as GDB, sanitizers (ASan/TSan/UBSan), or Valgrind, applied to problems that span multiple interacting software or hardware components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing automated tests with frameworks such as GoogleTest, including meaningful unit and integration test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robotics &amp;amp; Industrial Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with robotics, industrial automation, or embedded systems, including industrial communication protocols such as EtherCAT, CAN, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware-in-the-Loop Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with hardware-in-the-loop, simulation, fault-injection, or other automated system-testing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedded Linux:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with real-time or performance-sensitive Linux systems, or with the deployment side of embedded Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using Python for testing, automation, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using AI-assisted development tools, combined with critically reviewing and validating the generated output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
